# Adjudicated: see AGENTS.md in this directory.
#
# These assets are required — engine/tests/loaders/test_repartee_art_packs.py
# asserts the size, mode and sha256 of every one — so under root AGENTS.md
# rule 3 they must not depend on Git LFS having materialized. Stored as
# ordinary git blobs, overriding the repository-wide `*.png` LFS rule.
#
# `-export-ignore` is unset explicitly, not merely omitted. The root rule
# pairs `export-ignore` with LFS because an LFS pointer in an archive is
# useless, and an attribute this file does not mention stays inherited --
# so dropping the word would leave these excluded from `git archive` while
# looking fixed. These are the one set of PNGs that can survive an archive,
# and the tests above require them to.
#
# About 1 MB across fourteen files. Source renders stay out of the tree
# entirely; see AGENTS.md.
*.png -filter -diff -merge -text -export-ignore
